# Astral — Focus 10 ("mind awake, body asleep") — ~30 min — alpha 10 induction -> theta ~5 hold -> gentle return to alpha 10
# Goal: Monroe Hemi-Sync style OBE launch state. Alpha induction, slow descent to a
#       long flat deep-theta hold ("body asleep, mind awake"), then a GENTLE multi-minute
#       return up to alpha so the user resurfaces calmly (NOT a sleep/soft-off ending).
# Bands: induction alpha 10 Hz; descent 10->5 Hz; deep theta plateau ~5 Hz (the core);
#        return 5->10 Hz. Beat method: BINAURAL only (headphones).
# Driver: binaural. freq_r FIXED at 146 Hz; the beat slides by ramping the CARRIER
#         136->141 Hz (beat = freq_r - carrier), per guidelines 5a (freq_r is NOT
#         interpolatable). Low, warm carrier (~136-141 Hz "Om"-range) for long comfort.
# LED: OBE wants NEAR-DARKNESS. Warm amber only (R255 G80 B0), VERY dim (<=15%), and
#      NO flicker (LED freq 0 = steady-on); the only visual motion is a slow breathing
#      brightness LFO. Deep hold dims to a near-dark ~5% ember. Visual channel never
#      dominates. Four zones (mask 15).
# SAFETY (guidelines 4): no flicker at all (0 Hz steady) so we are far below the 15-25 Hz
#   photosensitive band; binaural carrier ~140 Hz (<1000), L/R offset = beat <=10 Hz (<35);
#   warm amber (no saturated red, no red<->blue alternation); brightness capped <=15% with
#   ramp-in 15 s and fade-out 60 s (both >=10 s), never stopped abruptly; volume fades in
#   60 s. Return phase actively raises the beat to bring the listener up, not down.
#
# Ramp convention = animate-on-start (5a): the > prefix sits on the row where a segment
# BEGINS; its value is the start; the target is the next same-channel/field row over the gap.

# --- Induction: alpha 10 Hz (00:00-06:00): vol + light fade in ---
0 0 50 >0 255 80 0 10            # LED steady amber (no flicker), brightness ramps 0->15% over 15 s
A 0 136 0 >0 0 1 146 0           # ch1 binaural: carrier 136 / freq_r 146 => 10 Hz beat; vol fades 0->40 over 60 s; sine
S 3000 default 47 "Relax completely. Let the body grow heavy and still, and simply rest."
15000 0 50 15 255 80 0 10        # brightness reaches 15% (ramp-in >=10 s done)
30000 0 50 ~6:12:12000 255 80 0 10   # breathing LFO engages: brightness sine 6<->12% over 12 s
A 60000 136 0 80 0 1 146 0       # vol reaches 40; carrier held 136 => alpha 10 Hz through induction

# --- Descent to theta (06:00-12:00, beat 10->5 Hz) ---
A 360000 >136 0 80 0 1 146 0     # carrier ramps 136->141 => beat 10->5 over 6 min (~0.83 Hz/min)
360000 0 50 ~4:10:12000 255 80 0 10  # LED dims further, gentle breathing 4<->10%
S 360000 default 47 "Let go now, drifting downward, deeper and deeper with every breath."

# --- Deep theta plateau: long flat hold (12:00-24:00 = 12 min, beat ~5 Hz) ---
A 720000 141 0 80 0 1 146 0      # carrier fixed 141 => beat 5 Hz held flat (dwell >> 6 min); "mind awake, body asleep"
720000 0 50 5 255 80 0 10        # near-dark: steady amber ember ~5%, no flicker, held still
S 720000 default 47 "Mind awake, body asleep. Rest here at the threshold, quiet and open."

# --- Gentle return to alpha (24:00-29:00, beat 5->10 Hz) ---
A 1440000 >141 0 80 0 1 146 0    # carrier ramps 141->136 => beat 5->10 over 5 min; resurface, not sleep
1440000 0 50 >5 255 80 0 10      # brightness ramps 5->12% back up over the return
S 1440000 default 47 "Gently now. Beginning to return, slowly rising toward the surface."

# --- Soft close (29:00-30:00): vol + brightness fade out ---
A 1740000 136 0 >80 0 1 146 0    # beat back at alpha 10 Hz; vol ramps 40->0 over final 60 s
1740000 0 50 >12 255 80 0 10     # brightness fades 12->0 over 60 s (>=10 s), never abrupt
S 1740000 default 47 "Coming back to the room now, calm, clear, and whole."
A 1800000 136 0 0 0 1 146 0      # end: volume 0
1800000 0 50 0 255 80 0 10       # end: brightness 0
